		{"id":"uncertainty","type":"text","x":0,"y":2090,"width":500,"height":330,"color":"2","text":"### Uncertainty<br><br>- Long-term data are thin<br>- Group rankings are not prescribing guidance<br>- Quality of life did not move with symptoms"},
		{"id":"hypothesis","type":"text","x":560,"y":2090,"width":560,"height":330,"color":"6","text":"### Open questions<br><br>- What distinguishes adult-onset presentations from childhood-onset ones?<br>- How should objective measures complement rating scales in assessment?<br>- How do arousal-state effects translate into human cognitive performance?"},
